    "Details": "This Apollo, designed for Tamarind-Abbey, was basically turned around. Mounting a Better Engine and Short Range Missiles made this a Cavalry Mech instead of a Support Fire Mech. In the Wake of increased Pirate Raids, the Duchy was in need of Fast Response Units with acceptable Reliability and without Supply Issues. As Streak SRM's are Ammo Efficient the added NARC only Increases the Efficiency of this Mech. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>",
